<title>USA: Baldor completes Optimised Control deal.</title>
<headline>Baldor completes Optimised Control deal.</headline>
<dateline>FORT SMITH, Ark. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baldor Electric Co said Monday it has completed its acquisition of Optimised Control Ltd, a Bristol, England,-based designer and marker of motion control products.</p>
<p>Baldor said it estimates that the acquisition will be neutral to its earnings per share in the first year and will be accretive afterwards.</p>
<p>The transaction was paid for in a combination of cash and Baldor common stock, the company said. The amount of the deal was not disclosed.</p>
<p>Baldor is a supplier of industrial motors and drives.</p>
</text>
